<p class="govuk-body">
  You no longer have access to this case because you have informed the court that you are represented by a solicitor. Please contact your solicitor if you need information about your case or wish to discuss your next steps.
</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">If you need help</h2>

<p class="govuk-body">
  Court staff can assist you with questions about your application, but they cannot provide legal advice. For legal advice, please contact your solicitor or an independent legal adviser.
</p>
